proposal = "Regenerate or link a current c-harness reference in spec/layerx-merge/contracts/test-harness.md from reconciled API rows, and label/archive the old pinned status clearly. Describe supported --list and --run behavior while preserving the historical UNRUN evidence markers as historical facts."
